# Backend Hexagonal

Read and obey `harness/constitutions/backend.md`.

- Python 3.13 + uv + FastAPI + SQLAlchemy 2 async + Alembic + **loguru**.
- Hexagonal layout under `app/src/{core,domain,use_cases,ports,adapters}`.
- `app/src/core/logging.py` is the only loguru configuration entrypoint.
- Customize FastAPI `lifespan` to ping Postgres/Redis/Rabbit(/Mongo) and other required deps.
- Also obey `harness/constitutions/data.md` for schema/index/FK rules.
- Absolute imports from `app`. Empty `__init__.py`.
- Unit + acceptance tests only inside the service. No cross-service integration tests here.
- Async connectors only. Named arguments. Docstrings in Portuguese.
- Repo name must be `service-<intent>`.
